# ==============================================================================
# SAHAYA Rural Healthcare Platform — Root Environment Overview (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# The SAHAYA architecture separates concerns between frontend and backend:
#
# 1. Backend Server Environment:
#    Location: `server/.env`
#    Template: `server/.env.example`
#    Contains: PORT, DATABASE_URL (Neon pooled & unpooled), JWT_SECRET, etc.
#
# 2. Frontend Client Environment:
#    Location: `client/.env`
#    Template: `client/.env.example`
#    Contains: VITE_API_URL, VITE_ENABLE_WEARABLE_POLLING, etc.
#
# 3. Neon Cloud Database CLI Context:
#    Location: `.env.local`
#    Contains: NEON_PROJECT_ID, NEON_BRANCH, DATABASE_URL
# ==============================================================================

# Quick Setup Commands:
# 1. Backend setup:
#    cp server/.env.example server/.env
#
# 2. Frontend setup:
#    cp client/.env.example client/.env
#
# 3. Neon setup (if using Neon CLI):
#    neon link --project-id <your-project-id> --branch production
